{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-title='Apache HTTPD'>\r\n\t\t\tApache HTTPD\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"mod_rewrite: References, RewriteBase, Example, RewriteRule, and Test.","label":"mod_rewrite","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mac","label":"Mac","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mac"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mode_rewrite_samples","label":"mode_rewrite samples","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mode_rewrite_samples"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>References<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/httpd.apache.org\/docs\/current\/rewrite\/flags.html\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttp:\/\/httpd.apache.org\/docs\/current\/mod\/mod_rewrite.html\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>RewriteEngine                &lt;On|Off&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>RewriteBase<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\/.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\/|.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tElse all paths must be preceded by \u2018\/\u2019.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>RewriteRule &lt;regex&gt; &lt;target&gt; [[Flags[,...]]]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Example<\/h2>\n\t<h2>RewriteRule<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t^\/zz$ \/X.html [PT].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWithout RewriteBase.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Test<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewriteRule ^Test$ Testing [R].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSimple Internal Redirect.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDefault.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThat is, no flag.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tExternal Redirect.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>RewriteRule<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t^\/foo\\.html$ bar.html [R].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Flags<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>_[_ &lt;flag[,]&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNo space to separate.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tComma separated.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tN and NC are entirely different.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>NC<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNo case.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCase insensitive.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>N<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tBegin re-evaluation from the beginning with present.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t! can result in a loop.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tR.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>L<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLast.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTerminate further evaluation.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewrite rules are recursed.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>RewriteLogLevel<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t[&gt;= 6].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>RewriteLog<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSYSOUT.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>RewriteDocument        &lt;ErrorNo&gt;        \u201cMessage\u201d|URL<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewrite condition.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>RewriteCond &lt;expression&gt; -&lt;test&gt; &lt;combination&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>RewriteCond &lt;RewriteRule&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;expression&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;expression&gt; Variables : %{&lt;variable&gt;}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>REQUEST_FILENAME<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFull path of the request.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>C:\/_\/..        Windows<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>REQUEST_URI<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPath after first slash.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;test&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\u2018!\u2019 for inversion.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>-&lt;operator&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>operator<\/h2>\n\t<h4>f<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFile.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>d<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDirectory.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;combination&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\u2018[OR]\u2019.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCascading conditions for a single rule.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Tip.<\/strong> To debug you may print the expanded condition expression by using it in a rewriterule target.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t?requestURI got repeated a few times?\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Redirect 404 \/<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRedirects 404 errors to page.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mod_rewrite\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mod_rewrite\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mac' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mac' data-title='Mac' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Mac<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mode_rewrite_samples' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/mode_rewrite_samples' data-title='mode_rewrite samples' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>mode_rewrite samples<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-title='Apache HTTPD'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Apache HTTPD<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}